8.43 In a twelve-syllable metre: camasām iva, avri, vasavāna, sṛja asya, vimadasya, / sumakhāya, dhāraya, dadātu, rakṣa, dhiyā dadhātu, and didhiṣeya;

9.45 'rarakṣa', 'yava stenam', 'sasāhe', 'yavayā vadham', 'paramayā', 'dravayanta', 'śravayan', and 'rarate ca na'.

